        },
        "description": "Monica Everett is famously known as the Silent Witch for being the only human capable of casting spells without chanting. Exceedingly shy, she had trouble conversing with others; and in the worst cases, faints when meeting strangers. Because this crippling anxiety affected her performance at a magic academy, Monica decided to bypass her fears by avoiding chanting entirely. No longer hampered by the time lag inherent in casting spells, she overcame the greatest weakness of all sorcerers and was recognized as one of the Seven Sages for her accomplishment.",
